#: cart-rules-for-woocommerce.php:72
msgid "%1$s needs WooCommerce %2$s or newer. Please update WooCommerce."
msgstr "%1$s benötigt WooCommerce %2$s oder neuer. Bitte WooCommerce aktualisieren."

#: cart-rules-for-woocommerce.php:74
msgid "%s needs WooCommerce to be installed and active."
msgstr "%s benötigt ein installiertes und aktives WooCommerce."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:44
msgid "Minimum quantity"
msgstr "Mindestmenge"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:47
msgid "Store default: %s"
msgstr "Shop-Standard: %s"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:48
msgid "No minimum"
msgstr "Kein Minimum"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:50
msgid "The smallest quantity of this product a customer may order. For a variable product the variations count together. Leave empty to use the store default."
msgstr "Die kleinste Menge dieses Produkts, die ein Kunde bestellen darf. Bei variablen Produkten zählen die Varianten zusammen. Leer lassen, um den Shop-Standard zu verwenden."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:64
msgid "Minimum spend (%s)"
msgstr "Mindestbetrag (%s)"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:70
msgid "The smallest amount a customer must spend on this product (quantity × price). Leave empty to use the store default."
msgstr "Der kleinste Betrag, den ein Kunde für dieses Produkt ausgeben muss (Menge × Preis). Leer lassen, um den Shop-Standard zu verwenden."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:79
msgid "No minimums"
msgstr "Keine Minima"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:80
msgid "Exempt this product from every minimum, including the store defaults."
msgstr "Dieses Produkt von allen Minima ausnehmen, einschließlich der Shop-Standards."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:101
msgid "Allowed shipping methods"
msgstr "Erlaubte Versandarten"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:102
msgid "Any shipping method"
msgstr "Jede Versandart"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:111
msgid "Only these methods are offered when this product is in the cart. With several restricted products in one cart, only the methods they all allow are offered. Leave empty to allow every method."
msgstr "Nur diese Versandarten werden angeboten, wenn dieses Produkt im Warenkorb liegt. Bei mehreren eingeschränkten Produkten werden nur die Versandarten angeboten, die alle erlauben. Leer lassen, um jede Versandart zu erlauben."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-product-data.php:114
msgid "No shipping methods are configured yet. Add some under WooCommerce → Settings → Shipping."
msgstr "Es sind noch keine Versandarten eingerichtet. Lege welche unter WooCommerce → Einstellungen → Versand an."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:23
msgid "Cart Rules"
msgstr "Warenkorb-Regeln"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:39
msgid "Whole cart"
msgstr "Gesamter Warenkorb"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:41
msgid "Rules that apply to the order as a whole. Per-product minimums and allowed shipping methods are set on each product's edit screen (General and Shipping tabs)."
msgstr "Regeln für die Bestellung als Ganzes. Minima je Produkt und erlaubte Versandarten werden auf der Bearbeitungsseite des jeweiligen Produkts festgelegt (Reiter „Allgemein“ und „Versand“)."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:47
msgid "Minimum order amount (%s)"
msgstr "Mindestbestellwert (%s)"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:50
msgid "Customers cannot check out below this amount. Leave empty for no minimum."
msgstr "Unter diesem Betrag können Kunden nicht zur Kasse gehen. Leer lassen für kein Minimum."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:60
msgid "Compare against"
msgstr "Vergleichen mit"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:61
msgid "Which cart figure the minimum order amount is checked against. Shipping is never included; tax follows the “Display prices during cart and checkout” setting."
msgstr "Mit welchem Warenkorbwert der Mindestbestellwert verglichen wird. Versand zählt nie mit; die Steuer folgt der Einstellung „Preise im Warenkorb und an der Kasse anzeigen“."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:69
msgid "Subtotal (before coupons)"
msgstr "Zwischensumme (vor Gutscheinen)"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:70
msgid "Total after coupons"
msgstr "Summe nach Gutscheinen"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:79
msgid "Per-product defaults"
msgstr "Standards je Produkt"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:81
msgid "Applied to every product that has no value of its own. A product can override these, or opt out with “No minimums”."
msgstr "Gilt für jedes Produkt ohne eigenen Wert. Ein Produkt kann diese überschreiben oder sich mit „Keine Minima“ ausnehmen."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:85
msgid "Default minimum quantity"
msgstr "Standard-Mindestmenge"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:86
msgid "The smallest quantity of any one product a customer may order."
msgstr "Die kleinste Menge eines einzelnen Produkts, die ein Kunde bestellen darf."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:101
msgid "Default minimum spend (%s)"
msgstr "Standard-Mindestbetrag (%s)"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:104
msgid "The smallest amount a customer must spend on any one product."
msgstr "Der kleinste Betrag, den ein Kunde für ein einzelnes Produkt ausgeben muss."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:114
msgid "Quantity fields"
msgstr "Mengenfelder"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:115
msgid "Start quantity fields and “Add to cart” buttons at the product's minimum quantity"
msgstr "Mengenfelder und „In den Warenkorb“-Buttons bei der Mindestmenge des Produkts beginnen lassen"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:121
msgid "Product page"
msgstr "Produktseite"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:122
msgid "Show the product's minimum under its price"
msgstr "Das Minimum des Produkts unter dem Preis anzeigen"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:133
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "Meldungen"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:135
msgid "What customers read when a rule is not met. Leave a field empty to use the default shown as its placeholder. Placeholders: {product}, {products}, {min}, {current}."
msgstr "Was Kunden lesen, wenn eine Regel nicht erfüllt ist. Ein Feld leer lassen, um den als Platzhalter gezeigten Standardtext zu verwenden. Platzhalter: {product}, {products}, {min}, {current}."

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:139
msgid "Minimum quantity not met"
msgstr "Mindestmenge nicht erreicht"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:147
msgid "Minimum spend not met"
msgstr "Mindestbetrag nicht erreicht"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:155
msgid "Minimum order amount not met"
msgstr "Mindestbestellwert nicht erreicht"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:163
msgid "No shipping method shared by all items"
msgstr "Keine gemeinsame Versandart für alle Artikel"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:171
msgid "Product page note"
msgstr "Hinweis auf der Produktseite"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:184
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deinstallation"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:189
msgid "Remove data"
msgstr "Daten entfernen"

#: includes/admin/class-crfw-settings.php:190
msgid "Delete all settings and per-product rules when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr "Beim Löschen des Plugins alle Einstellungen und Produktregeln entfernen"

#: includes/class-crfw-cart.php:307
msgid "%s item"
msgid_plural "%s items"
msgstr[0] "%s Stück"
msgstr[1] "%s Stück"

#: includes/class-crfw-plugin.php:74
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-crfw-plugin.php:89
msgid "Docs"
msgstr "Dokumentation"

#: includes/class-crfw-plugin.php:90
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Support"

#: includes/class-crfw-plugin.php:91
msgid "Buy me a coffee ☕"
msgstr "Spendier mir einen Kaffee ☕"

#: includes/class-crfw-plugin.php:105
msgid "Telegram"
msgstr "Telegram"

#: includes/class-crfw-plugin.php:110
msgid "Enjoying it? %s"
msgstr "Gefällt es dir? %s"

#: includes/class-crfw-shipping.php:104
msgid "Any “%s” method"
msgstr "Jede Versandart „%s“"

#: includes/class-crfw-shipping.php:108
msgid "By method type (every zone)"
msgstr "Nach Versandart-Typ (alle Zonen)"

#: includes/class-crfw-shipping.php:122
msgid "%s (disabled)"
msgstr "%s (deaktiviert)"

#: includes/crfw-functions.php:57
msgid "“{product}” must be ordered in a quantity of at least {min} (you have {current})."
msgstr "„{product}“ muss in einer Menge von mindestens {min} bestellt werden (du hast {current})."

#: includes/crfw-functions.php:59
msgid "“{product}” requires a minimum purchase of {min} (you have {current})."
msgstr "„{product}“ erfordert einen Mindestbetrag von {min} (du hast {current})."

#: includes/crfw-functions.php:61
msgid "A minimum order of {min} is required to check out (your order is {current})."
msgstr "Für die Bestellung ist ein Mindestbestellwert von {min} erforderlich (deine Bestellung: {current})."

#: includes/crfw-functions.php:63
msgid "The items in your cart cannot be shipped together: no shipping method is available for all of them. Please order {products} separately."
msgstr "Die Artikel in deinem Warenkorb können nicht zusammen versendet werden: Es gibt keine Versandart, die für alle verfügbar ist. Bitte bestelle {products} separat."

#: includes/crfw-functions.php:65
msgid "Minimum order: {min}"
msgstr "Mindestbestellung: {min}"
